   "text": "Cretin-Derham Hall High School - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nCretin-Derham Hall High School\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nAt Cretin-Derham Hall, students attend a beautiful, historic high school known for its rigorous academics, strong extracurriculars, and championship-winning athletics. The school offers students incredible programs and opportunities, including 1:1 mentoring programs where students are paired with mentors from world-renowned accounting firms, over 40 STEM courses in a wide range of fields an and a unique Leadership Academy. The school also has an award-winning arts program, with opportunities in fine and performing arts. The school is in a beautiful, historic building, while also offering students advanced technology (including virtual reality headsets and digital microscopes) and recently-renovated athletic facilities. Outside of the classroom, Cretin-Derham Hall offers students a robust extracurricular program, with clubs and championship-winning athletic teams. \nTimestamps\nUpdated\n27/03/2026 06:29\nby Gunia Beniwal\nCreated\n27/03/2026 06:29\nby Gunia Beniwal\nType\nHigh School\nCountry\nUnited States\nYearly Fees\nMax: US$64,650.00\nMin: US$58,185.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n15%\n154 of 1,030 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPublic\nProvider\nDirect QS\nFounded Year\n1987\nCampus(es)\nMinnesota\nCountry\nUnited States\nExcluded Countries\nNA\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n20/10/2023\nContract End Date\n23/10/2026\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nExpiring in 90 days\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nAccommodation available\nScholarship Offered\nScholarship available\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4V